Designed a relational database using Customers, Products, Orders, Order Details, Suppliers, and Reviews tables.
Applied SQL concepts including DDL, DML, constraints, joins, aggregations, subqueries, normalization, and transactions.
Analyzed business performance including sales, revenue, orders, product performance, and high-value customers.
Built a 3-page Power BI dashboard covering Business Overview, Customer Insights, and Product & Reviews.
Generated actionable insights on customer behavior, product performance, popular categories, and customer ratings.
